We will start by conducting an Inception & Design phase, where we will work closely with the client to understand their specific needs and requirements. This will be followed by a Pilot / MVP phase, where we will develop a minimum viable product that can be tested and validated by the client. We will then proceed with a Full Rollout phase, where we will deploy the tool to the entirety of the services.

To ensure compliance with the City of Belval's requirements, we will maintain a RAID log, a Decision log, and a Change request process. We will also establish a Steering committee that will meet on a monthly basis to review progress and provide guidance. Additionally, we will provide Weekly status reports and Quarterly executive reviews to keep the client informed.

