In terms of risk management, we will maintain a risk register and review it bi-weekly. We have identified standard risk categories such as Technical, Financial, Regulatory, Operational, and Reputational, and we will work to mitigate these risks throughout the project.

We believe that our proposed methodology, based on Agile Scrum and our experience in delivering similar projects, will ensure successful delivery and compliance with the City of Belval's requirements.
